<title>USA: Sherwin-Williams Co Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Sherwin-Williams Co Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.13		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net		 23,134		   19,593</p>
<p> Net Sales	 1,069,787		857,771</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  172,335,790	    172,395,202</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The financial results for the three months ended March 31, 1997 include the results of operations of Thompson Minwax Holding Corp, acquired in Jan. 1997, and other smaller acquisitions acquired at various times since the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Excluding the results of operations of these acquisitions and the related costs of financing, the purchases from the first quarter of 1997, sales increased to $907,604,000 and earnings per share increased to $0.13 per share.</p>
</text>
